#: src/Authorization/Roles.php:34
msgid "Orchestra Member"
msgstr "Orchestermitglied"

#: src/Authorization/Roles.php:35
msgid "Orchestra Conductor"
msgstr "Orchesterdirigent"

#: src/Authorization/Roles.php:36
msgid "Orchestra Organizer"
msgstr "Orchesterorganisator"

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:152
#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:206
msgid "Orchestra files are private"
msgstr "Orchesterdateien sind privat"

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:170
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sicherheit"

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:174
msgid "Private Orchestra files can be downloaded by anyone"
msgstr "Private Orchesterdateien können von jedem heruntergeladen werden"

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:178
msgid ""
"Anyone who knows the address of a file in these folders can download it "
"without logging in."
msgstr ""
"Wer die Adresse einer Datei in diesen Ordnern kennt, kann sie ohne Login "
"herunterladen."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:181
msgid "The web server ignores their .htaccess file, e.g. because it is nginx."
msgstr ""
"Der Webserver beachtet ihre .htaccess-Datei nicht, z. B. weil er nginx ist."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:190
msgid "Whether the Orchestra files are private could not be checked"
msgstr "Ob die Orchesterdateien privat sind, konnte nicht geprüft werden"

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:194
msgid ""
"The site could not request a test file from these folders, e.g. because it "
"cannot reach itself."
msgstr ""
"Die Website konnte keine Testdatei aus diesen Ordnern abrufen, z. B. weil "
"sie sich selbst nicht erreicht."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:197
msgid "Check them yourself, or move them outside the web root."
msgstr "Prüfe sie selbst oder verschiebe sie außerhalb des Web-Verzeichnisses."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:210
msgid ""
"Sheet music and email attachments cannot be downloaded through their folders."
msgstr ""
"Noten und E-Mail-Anhänge können nicht über ihre Ordner heruntergeladen "
"werden."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:213
msgid "They are only delivered to users who may see them."
msgstr "Sie werden nur an Benutzer ausgeliefert, die sie sehen dürfen."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:257 src/Ui/LoginMenuItem.php:73
#: src/Ui/NavigationShortcodes.php:33 src/Ui/PageSetup.php:34
#: src/Ui/PageSetup.php:74
msgid "Orchestra"
msgstr "Orchester"

#. translators: %s: list of folders, e.g. "Sheet music, Email attachments"
#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:260
#, php-format
msgid "Private files can be downloaded without logging in (%s)."
msgstr "Private Dateien können ohne Login heruntergeladen werden (%s)."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:263
msgid "Site Health explains how to protect them."
msgstr "Der Website-Zustand erklärt, wie du sie schützt."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:372
msgid ""
"Recommended: add these lines to wp-config.php, with folders outside the web "
"root that PHP can write to."
msgstr ""
"Empfohlen: Füge diese Zeilen in die wp-config.php ein, mit Ordnern außerhalb "
"des Web-Verzeichnisses, in die PHP schreiben kann."

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:375
msgid "Move the files already stored into them:"
msgstr "Verschiebe die bereits gespeicherten Dateien dorthin:"

#: src/Files/PrivateDirectoryCheck.php:379
msgid "Or, on nginx, deny the folders in the server configuration:"
msgstr "Oder sperre die Ordner unter nginx in der Server-Konfiguration:"

#. translators: %s: date
#: src/Pdf/Pdf.php:35
#, php-format
msgid "Created on %s"
msgstr "Erstellt am %s"

#: src/Pdf/Pdf.php:128
msgid "Page {PAGE_NUM} of {PAGE_COUNT}"
msgstr "Seite {PAGE_NUM} von {PAGE_COUNT}"

#: src/Ui/EmailMoved.php:39
msgid ""
"Emails are now a plugin of their own: Orchestra Email. Install and activate "
"it to write emails again; your sent emails and emails that are still being "
"sent are kept."
msgstr ""
"E-Mails sind jetzt ein eigenes Plugin: Orchestra Email. Installiere und "
"aktiviere es, um wieder E-Mails zu schreiben; deine gesendeten E-Mails und E-"
"Mails, die noch verschickt werden, bleiben erhalten."

#: src/Ui/EmailMoved.php:43
msgid "Download Orchestra Email"
msgstr "Orchestra Email herunterladen"

